Every Imlek, I would bake trays of nastar with my mother and sister. Its design varies depending on that year's Chinese zodiac. For example, we did roosters for 2017.
It's a pretty new tradition for our family, but nastar has been a popular cookie for Imlek and Lebaran in Indonesia for a long time.
It's not that time of year right now, so we can decorate however we like!
[end_timeline]
label decorate (decorate)
Nastar and almost every other kue we have originated from our time as a Dutch colony. Not sure how to feel about that.
Nah screw those guys. We made it our own and it's delicious.
